# Understand-Anything (/understand) working directory. The WHOLE of .ua/ is
# per-clone output: the nightly-documentation-update scheduled task regenerates
# knowledge-graph.json + meta.json in place every night, so while they were
# tracked they sat dirty in the shared checkout for up to 6 days a week, got
# swept into `git pull --rebase --autostash` stashes (2026-07-19, 2026-09-23)
# and blocked auto-pulls (2026-09-04). The consumable weekly snapshot is
# committed at docs/understand/ instead -- a path the plugin never writes --
# see docs/understand/README.md.
.ua/
